{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/8c7c44f89e56686a2b1b1c90a8d86b8f.avif?t=1772578555\" alt=\"Flappy bullet hell\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras_big/8c7c44f89e56686a2b1b1c90a8d86b8f.webp?t=1772578555 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a lightning-charged mouse who flaps its ears to move. Fight increasingly difficult monsters with automatically fired bolts of lightning as your primary weapon. You\u2019ll be on the edge of your seat through 30 distinct waves across three levels. Each wave is unique and has a different attack, making every encounter tense, unpredictable, and packed with action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/425e951d3a5f1e8a0abc339d564fdb0e.poster.avif?t=1772578555\" aria-label=\"Mouse flapping through many projectiles\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/425e951d3a5f1e8a0abc339d564fdb0e.webm?t=1772578555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/425e951d3a5f1e8a0abc339d564fdb0e.mp4?t=1772578555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/e88330b82892a79c1b0d27fe0ab60494.avif?t=1772578555\" alt=\"Powerful upgrades\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras_big/e88330b82892a79c1b0d27fe0ab60494.webp?t=1772578555 width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins from defeated enemies to upgrade 24 different properties and unique abilities called \u201cWishes.\u201d These include powerful new weapons, economic effects, weapon modifiers, stat boosts, and more, fueling a strong progression curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/9d77568589543a636d71c10d55731821.poster.avif?t=1772578555\" aria-label=\"Upgrades\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/9d77568589543a636d71c10d55731821.webm?t=1772578555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/9d77568589543a636d71c10d55731821.mp4?t=1772578555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/a50d2a0043fb2bea99931607a60f2c0f.avif?t=1772578555\" alt=\"Epic boss battles\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras_big/a50d2a0043fb2bea99931607a60f2c0f.webp?t=1772578555 width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer huge bosses at the end of each level. With layered attack patterns and multiple phases, these extended battles deliver a distinct challenge beyond regular enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/99b888dc1bb3fcbce4fd76d0d069b389.poster.avif?t=1772578555\" aria-label=\"Boss fight\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/99b888dc1bb3fcbce4fd76d0d069b389.webm?t=1772578555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/99b888dc1bb3fcbce4fd76d0d069b389.mp4?t=1772578555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/fdd5b22a1fb0f47b66126d31ee0f3b7a.avif?t=1772578555\" alt=\"Immense power trip\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras_big/fdd5b22a1fb0f47b66126d31ee0f3b7a.webp?t=1772578555 width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When defeated, you lose your coins and restart from the beginning of the level, but keep your acquired Wishes. This makes you more powerful each time you begin a new run, creating a thrilling sense of exponential domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/ea671fe50d4a9f0f925ac71a67b53e04.poster.avif?t=1772578555\" aria-label=\"Mouse becoming powerful and shooting many projectiles\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/ea671fe50d4a9f0f925ac71a67b53e04.webm?t=1772578555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/ea671fe50d4a9f0f925ac71a67b53e04.mp4?t=1772578555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/2ce5e6ef6af70af4004dfdf7c38b29ff.avif?t=1772578555\" alt=\"Distinctive flap-style movement\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras_big/2ce5e6ef6af70af4004dfdf7c38b29ff.webp?t=1772578555 width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flap left or right to move horizontally, and adjust your flapping speed to control altitude. You can also dash sideways to dodge tricky projectiles. This simple control scheme is easy to learn, yet offers expressive, skillful movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/0e32af452124d5d962d15e930d09b1f0.poster.avif?t=1772578555\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/0e32af452124d5d962d15e930d09b1f0.webm?t=1772578555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/0e32af452124d5d962d15e930d09b1f0.mp4?t=1772578555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365940?t=1772578555","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/3ab2b30947450096bf57b1e18845fd76835bf26b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772578555","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/8328dc3cf183f4e94b3217f9fdea2889d287fcc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772578555","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/8328dc3cf183f4e94b3217f9fdea2889d287fcc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772578555","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description"